BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tomorrow's Sentry
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261004T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261004T170000
UID:bat-202610041500-tomorrow-s-sentry@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. When 102-year-old Bloomington resident Dot Weaver dies\, sh
 e left behind fragments of a hidden history waiting to be discovered. Audi
 ences are taken on an unforgettable journey though Monroe County’s contr
 oversial history — from the post Civil War era to today.
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium @ Waldron Arts Center
URL:https://resilienceproductions.org/upcoming-productions
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
